 outreach, this team builds the trust, credibility, and brand identity that allows IRG to complete the mission.</p>","howWeDoItHtml","<ul>\n<li>Pre-deployment public briefings and community outreach messaging.</li>\n<li>Real-time social media updates and field documentation during active missions.</li>\n<li>Coordinate Traditional and Non-traditional media relations.</li>\n<li>Post-deployment donor impact reports and partner agency debriefs.</li>\n<li>Grant research, proposal writing, and compliance reporting for institutional funders.</li>\n<li>Brand management: consistent visual identity across all IRG platforms and materials.</li>\n<li>Volunteer recruitment campaigns and section-specific outreach.</li>\n</ul>","donationFundsHtml",{"_57":315,"_310":316,"_312":302},{"_57":313,"_310":314,"_312":304},{"_57":309,"_310":311,"_312":302},"what-your-donation-funds","heading","What your donation funds","html","how-we-do-it","How we do it","what-we-do","What we do"]
